<title>UK: MC values Gazprom at $1.28-$1.58/share.</title>
<headline>MC values Gazprom at $1.28-$1.58/share.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Russia's RAO Gazprom are worth between $1.28 and $1.58, depending on the level of &quot;Russia discount&quot; and company risk applied, according to a report from the head of MC Securities research department.</p>
<p>&quot;Gazprom is perhaps the largest gas company and one of the largest energy companies in the world. It offers a unique opportunity for investors in both the Russian and European energy sector,&quot; Stephen O'Sullivan said in a 168 page report.</p>
<p>Gazprom is undertaking an American Depositary Receipt issue, which has been indicated at a price equivalent to $1.40-$1.60 per underlying share.</p>
</text>
